  "id": "ismip/ismip7-gris-forcing",
  "title": "ISMIP7 Greenland Ice Sheet Forcing",
  "description": "Downscaled atmospheric and oceanic forcing data for the Greenland Ice Sheet, prepared for the ISMIP7 ice sheet model intercomparison project. Includes surface forcing derived from CESM2-WACCM and MRI-ESM2-0 for control and historical periods and five SSP scenarios at 1 km and 4 km resolution via three downscaling methods, ocean thermal forcing and salinity, and reanalysis-driven forcing from RACMO2.3p2-ERA and EN4.",
